{"seq":2,"slug":"mixing-tuning","title":"混合与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/practice/mixing-tuning","wordCount":1291,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"混合与调优\">混合与调优</h1><p><a href=\"convergence-diagnostics\">收敛诊断</a> 告诉你链病了——R-hat 卡在 1.05、ESS 只有几十、迹图扭成一团、发散点成片。这一篇接手「然后呢」：把每一类病症对应到具体的修法。MCMC 调优的核心认知是，链混合慢九成不是采样器的错，而是<strong>后验几何</strong>对采样器不友好；与其换更猛的采样器，不如把后验「掰」成采样器喜欢的形状。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「混合（mixing）」指链在后验上游走、探索整个分布的速度。混合好，相邻样本几乎不相关、ESS 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>；混合差，链在一处反复打转、自相关高、ESS 塌方。混合差的根源几乎总能归到三类几何病症：<strong>参数强相关</strong>（后验是狭长斜山谷，各向同性提议爬不动）、<strong>尺度差异悬殊</strong>（不同参数量纲差几个数量级，统一步长顾此失彼）、<strong>病态曲率</strong>（如层次模型的漏斗，曲率随位置剧变，固定步长在某处必失稳）。对症下药的总思路是：要么改坐标让病消失（重参数化），要么让采样器适配几何（调步长、估质量矩阵），二选一或并用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[诊断报警: 混合慢] --&gt; B{病症类型?}&#10;  B --&gt;|参数强相关| C[重参数化去相关&lt;br/&gt;或块更新 / 估满质量矩阵]&#10;  B --&gt;|尺度差异悬殊| D[标准化参数&lt;br/&gt;非对角质量矩阵]&#10;  B --&gt;|漏斗/病态曲率| E[中心化↔非中心化&lt;br/&gt;重参数化掰直漏斗]&#10;  B --&gt;|HMC 发散多| F[先调高 target_accept 治标&lt;br/&gt;再重参数化治本]&#10;  C --&gt; G[复查 R-hat / ESS / 发散]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{达标?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| B&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[收敛, 交付]\">flowchart TD\n  A[诊断报警: 混合慢] --&gt; B{病症类型?}\n  B --&gt;|参数强相关| C[重参数化去相关&lt;br/&gt;或块更新 / 估满质量矩阵]\n  B --&gt;|尺度差异悬殊| D[标准化参数&lt;br/&gt;非对角质量矩阵]\n  B --&gt;|漏斗/病态曲率| E[中心化↔非中心化&lt;br/&gt;重参数化掰直漏斗]\n  B --&gt;|HMC 发散多| F[先调高 target_accept 治标&lt;br/&gt;再重参数化治本]\n  C --&gt; G[复查 R-hat / ESS / 发散]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{达标?}\n  H --&gt;|否| B\n  H --&gt;|是| I[收敛, 交付]</pre><h2 id=\"中心化-vs-非中心化-层次模型的招牌手术\">中心化 vs 非中心化：层次模型的招牌手术</h2><p>层次模型里最经典、也最值得记牢的一招是<strong>重参数化</strong>。考虑一个简单层次结构：组级效应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_j \\sim \\mathcal{N}(\\mu, \\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当数据少、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 被推向小值时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 死死夹住，后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\tau, \\theta_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面上呈一个细长的<strong>漏斗</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的可行区间越窄。固定步长的 HMC 在漏斗宽口处嫌步子小、在窄脖颈处又嫌步子大，必然发散。<strong>非中心化参数化（non-centered parameterization, NCP）</strong> 把模型改写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_j = \\mu + \\tau \\cdot \\tilde{\\theta}_j,\\qquad \\tilde{\\theta}_j \\sim \\mathcal{N}(0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2174em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>采样的是标准正态的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{\\theta}_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2174em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> <strong>先验独立</strong>，漏斗被「掰直」成一个规整的球。同一个模型、同一个 NUTS，换这一行写法，发散从几百降到零、ESS 翻几十倍。反过来，当数据<strong>充足</strong>、似然主导时，中心化（直接采 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）反而更好——所以这是个要看数据量做选择的手术，不是无脑套 NCP。</p>\n<h2 id=\"步长-质量矩阵与-warmup\">步长、质量矩阵与 warmup</h2><p>对 HMC/NUTS，<a href=\"../modern/nuts-sampler\">NUTS</a> 已经把步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 和质量矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的整定自动化进 warmup，但用户仍有可调旋钮：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>拉长 warmup</strong>：默认（如 Stan 的 1000 步）对病态后验可能不够，质量矩阵没估准。加长 warmup 让对偶平均和协方差估计更稳。</li>\n<li><strong>调 <code>target_accept</code></strong>：发散多时从 0.8 调到 0.9–0.99，迫使更小步长。记住这是治标——更慢、且掩盖而非消除几何问题。</li>\n<li><strong>满质量矩阵 vs 对角</strong>：默认对角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 假设参数独立；强相关时改估<strong>满（dense）质量矩阵</strong>，让动量适配相关结构，相当于自动预条件。代价是 warmup 更贵、高维下不稳。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>病症 / 诊断信号</th>\n<th>首选修法</th>\n<th>备选</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强相关（迹图慢漂移，ESS 低）</td>\n<td>重参数化去相关</td>\n<td>满质量矩阵 / 块更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺度差异大</td>\n<td>标准化参数</td>\n<td>非对角质量矩阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏斗，发散聚集脖颈</td>\n<td>中心化↔非中心化切换</td>\n<td>调高 target_accept（治标）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>warmup 后仍不稳</td>\n<td>拉长 warmup</td>\n<td>换更好初值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"通用手段与-别做-的事\">通用手段与「别做」的事</h2><p>不限于 HMC 的几条通用招：<strong>标准化输入</strong>（把预测变量缩放到相近量纲）几乎总该做，能一次性缓解尺度差异；<strong>给合理初值</strong>，让多条链从后验高概率区附近起步，缩短 burn-in；<strong>多链并行</strong>，4 条以上既算诊断也分摊风险。还有两件被广泛误解、应当避免的事。其一是<strong>thinning（抽稀）</strong>：每隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 步留一个样本来「降自相关」——除非内存吃紧，否则它纯属浪费，丢掉的样本仍含信息，正确做法是直接用全部样本配 ESS 修正方差（见 <a href=\"convergence-diagnostics\">收敛诊断</a>）。其二是<strong>靠加长链硬扛病态几何</strong>：链跑十倍长也压不平一个漏斗，钱烧了病还在，先修几何再谈长度。前沿上还有打破细致平衡的非可逆采样器（<a href=\"../foundations/detailed-balance\">细致平衡</a> 提过）能进一步降自相关，但对绝大多数任务，把几何掰对 + 用好 NUTS 已经足够。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>混合慢九成源于后验几何病态，而非采样器不行；优先改几何而非换采样器。</li>\n<li>三类病症：强相关、尺度悬殊、病态曲率（漏斗），各有对应修法。</li>\n<li>层次模型的招牌手术是中心化↔非中心化切换，按数据量选择，能让发散归零。</li>\n<li>HMC 旋钮：拉长 warmup、调 target_accept（治标）、满质量矩阵；通用招：标准化、好初值、多链。</li>\n<li>别盲目 thinning，也别靠加长链硬扛病态几何。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"convergence-diagnostics\">收敛诊断</a>——调优的判据来源；<a href=\"../modern/nuts-sampler\">NUTS 与自适应</a>——步长与质量矩阵的自动整定；<a href=\"../samplers/gibbs-sampling\">Gibbs 采样</a>——块更新破强相关。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../optimization-theory/convex-optimization/convexity-properties\">凸性性质</a> 帮理解病态曲率；<a href=\"../../probability-statistics/random-variables/joint-distributions\">联合分布</a> 是参数相关性的概率基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"混合与调优","id":"混合与调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"中心化 vs 非中心化：层次模型的招牌手术","id":"中心化-vs-非中心化-层次模型的招牌手术"},{"level":2,"text":"步长、质量矩阵与 warmup","id":"步长-质量矩阵与-warmup"},{"level":2,"text":"通用手段与「别做」的事","id":"通用手段与-别做-的事"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"收敛诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/practice/convergence-diagnostics"},"next":{"title":"概率编程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/practice/mcmc-ppl"}}